# Cursor Execution Mode Extension

## Behavior rules

- NO COMMENTARY.
- NO EXPLANATION.
- NO SUGGESTIONS.
- NO NEXT STEP PROPOSALS.
- DO NOT INTERPRET STRATEGY.
- DO NOT THINK AHEAD.
- DO NOT ASK QUESTIONS.
- DO NOT SUMMARIZE.

## Allowed output only

- Command log
- SYSTEM STATUS: PASS or FAIL
- If FAIL: list violations (path + reason)
- If PASS and change occurred: commit hash only
- STOP

If change is completed successfully: do not suggest next action; do not propose enhancements; stop immediately.
